sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant ThreadTenantStorage
    participant ThreadLocal
    participant BusinessLogic

    Note over Client,BusinessLogic: Set Tenant Context
    Client->>ThreadTenantStorage: setTenantId(tenantId: "tenant123")
    activate ThreadTenantStorage
    Note right of ThreadTenantStorage: Print debug message: "Setting tenant ID tenant123"
    ThreadTenantStorage->>ThreadLocal: set(tenantId: "tenant123")
    activate ThreadLocal
    Note right of ThreadLocal: Store in thread-specific map
    deactivate ThreadLocal
    ThreadTenantStorage-->>Client: Return
    deactivate ThreadTenantStorage

    Note over Client,BusinessLogic: Execute Business Logic
    Client->>BusinessLogic: Execute business logic
    activate BusinessLogic
    
    Note over BusinessLogic,ThreadTenantStorage: Get Tenant Context
    BusinessLogic->>ThreadTenantStorage: getTenantId()
    activate ThreadTenantStorage
    Note right of ThreadTenantStorage: Print debug message: "Getting tenant ID"
    ThreadTenantStorage->>ThreadLocal: get()
    activate ThreadLocal
    ThreadLocal-->>ThreadTenantStorage: Return stored value: "tenant123"
    deactivate ThreadLocal
    ThreadTenantStorage-->>BusinessLogic: Return tenant ID: "tenant123"
    deactivate ThreadTenantStorage

    Note right of BusinessLogic: Use tenant context for operations (tenantId: "tenant123")
    BusinessLogic-->>Client: Return results
    deactivate BusinessLogic

    Note over Client,BusinessLogic: Clear Tenant Context
    Client->>ThreadTenantStorage: clear()
    activate ThreadTenantStorage
    ThreadTenantStorage->>ThreadLocal: remove()
    activate ThreadLocal
    Note right of ThreadLocal: Remove from thread-specific map
    deactivate ThreadLocal
    ThreadTenantStorage-->>Client: Return
    deactivate ThreadTenantStorage

    alt getTenantId called without setTenantId
        Note over BusinessLogic,ThreadLocal: ThreadLocal not initialized
        BusinessLogic->>ThreadTenantStorage: getTenantId()
        activate ThreadTenantStorage
        ThreadTenantStorage->>ThreadLocal: get()
        activate ThreadLocal
        ThreadLocal-->>ThreadTenantStorage: Return: null
        deactivate ThreadLocal
        ThreadTenantStorage-->>BusinessLogic: Return null
        deactivate ThreadTenantStorage
        Note right of ThreadTenantStorage: Null returned to caller
    end